{"schema":1,"revision":85487581,"page":{"pageid":8557118,"title":"食物組","displayTitle":"食物組","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Various_grains.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Various_grains.jpg/250px-Various_grains.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"169\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Various_grains.jpg/500px-Various_grains.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2700\" data-file-height=\"1825\" /></a><figcaption>穀物</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Hrushikesh_kulkarni_vegetables.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/Hrushikesh_kulkarni_vegetables.JPG/250px-Hrushikesh_kulkarni_vegetables.JPG?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/Hrushikesh_kulkarni_vegetables.JPG/500px-Hrushikesh_kulkarni_vegetables.JPG?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3264\" data-file-height=\"2448\" /></a><figcaption>蔬菜</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>食物組</b>又稱<b>食品組</b>，是指具有相似<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%90%A5%E5%85%BB\" title=\"營養\">營養</a>特性的食物的集合，而且同一組的食物中，它們在<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"生物分類\">生物分類</a>劃分上也比較相似。<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%9C%E4%B8%9A%E9%83%A8\" title=\"美國農業部\">美國農業部</a>就曾劃分了4-11個食物組。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"最常见的食物組\"><span id=\".E6.9C.80.E5.B8.B8.E8.A7.81.E7.9A.84.E9.A3.9F.E7.89.A9.E7.B5.84\"></span>最常見的食物組</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A3%9F%E7%89%A9%E7%B5%84&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：最常見的食物組\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A5%B6%E5%88%B6%E5%93%81\" title=\"奶製品\">奶製品</a></b>，<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-AU&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-AU-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-UK&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UK-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-US&#95;5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-US-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-AU&#95;3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-AU-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-UK&#95;4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UK-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>牛奶、黃油、<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%85%A5%E6%B2%B9_(%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"酥油 (印度)\">酥油</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%85%B8%E5%A5%B6\" title=\"酸奶\">酸奶</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B9%BE%E9%85%AA\" title=\"乾酪\">奶酪</a>、奶油和冰淇淋等都屬於奶製品。將乳製品列為為每日推薦攝入量的食物組受到了<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"哈佛大学公共卫生学院\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Harvard T.H. Chan School of Public Health\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%93%88%E4%BD%9B%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%8D%AB%E7%94%9F%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"哈佛大學公共衛生學院（頁面不存在）\">哈佛大學公共衛生學院</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harvard_T.H._Chan_School_of_Public_Health\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Harvard T.H. Chan School of Public Health\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Harvard T.H. Chan School of Public Health</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>的批評，他們指出，「研究表明，如此高的乳製品攝入量幾乎沒有什麼好處，而且有相當大的潛在危害。每天食用一到兩盒牛奶或其他乳製品是可以的，而且可能對兒童有一些好處。但出於多種原因，這對成年人來說並不是必需的。」<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B0%B4%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"水果\">水果</a></b>有時與<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%94%AC%E8%8F%9C\" title=\"蔬菜\">蔬菜</a>歸為一組，<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8B%B9%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"蘋果\">蘋果</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A9%99%E5%AD%90\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"橙子\">橙子</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A6%99%E8%95%89\" title=\"香蕉\">香蕉</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8E%93%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"莓果\">莓果</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9F%A0%E6%AA%AC\" title=\"檸檬\">檸檬</a>等都是水果。水果含有<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A2%B3%E6%B0%B4%E5%8C%96%E5%90%88%E7%89%A9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"碳水化合物\">碳水化合物</a>（主要以<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B3%96\" title=\"糖\">糖</a>的形式儲存）以及重要的<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BB%B4%E7%94%9F%E7%B4%A0\" title=\"維生素\">維生素</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9F%BF%E7%89%A9%E8%B4%A8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"礦物質\">礦物質</a>。</li>\n<li><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B0%B7%E7%89%A9\" title=\"穀物\">穀物</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B1%86%E7%B1%BB\" title=\"豆類\">豆類</a></b>有時又被簡稱為<b>穀物</b>。 <sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-AU&#95;3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-AU-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-UK&#95;4-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UK-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-US&#95;5-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-US-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E9%BA%A6\" title=\"小麥\">小麥</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A8%BB\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"稻\">大米</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%87%95%E9%BA%A6\" title=\"燕麥\">燕麥</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E9%BA%A6\" title=\"大麥\">大麥</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9D%A2%E5%8C%85\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"麵包\">麵包</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%84%8F%E5%A4%A7%E5%88%A9%E9%BA%B5\" title=\"義大利麵\">義大利麵</a>都屬於穀物。菜豆、<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E8%B1%86\" title=\"大豆\">大豆</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%89%81%E8%B1%86\" title=\"扁豆\">扁豆</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%B9%B0%E5%98%B4%E8%B1%86\" title=\"鷹嘴豆\">鷹嘴豆</a>都是豆類。穀物主要提供<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B7%80%E7%B2%89\" title=\"澱粉\">澱粉</a>。豆類主要提供<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B0%A8%E5%9F%BA%E9%85%B8\" title=\"胺基酸\">胺基酸</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A2%B3%E6%B0%B4%E5%8C%96%E5%90%88%E7%89%A9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"碳水化合物\">碳水化合物</a>。</li>\n<li><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%82%89%E7%B1%BB\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"肉類\">肉類</a></b>，有時又被稱為<b><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9B%8B%E7%99%BD%E8%B4%A8\" title=\"蛋白質\">蛋白質</a></b>。 <sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-AU&#95;3-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-AU-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-UK&#95;4-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UK-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-US&#95;5-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-US-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%B8%A1%E8%82%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"雞肉\">雞肉</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%B1%BC\" title=\"魚\">魚</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%AB%E9%B8%A1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"火雞\">火雞</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8C%AA%E8%82%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"豬肉\">豬肉</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%9B%E8%82%89\" title=\"牛肉\">牛肉</a>等都屬於肉類。</li>\n<li><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B3%96%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"糖果\">糖果</a></b>，也被稱為<b><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8F%93%E5%AD%90\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"菓子\">含糖食品</a></b>，有時與<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%84%82%E8%82%AA\" title=\"脂肪\">脂肪</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B2%B9\" title=\"油\">油類</a>分在一起。 <sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-AU&#95;3-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-AU-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-UK&#95;4-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UK-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B3%96%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"糖果\">糖果</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BB%9F%E6%80%A7%E9%A3%B2%E6%96%99\" title=\"軟性飲料\">軟飲料</a>和巧克力等都屬於糖果。</li>\n<li><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%94%AC%E8%8F%9C\" title=\"蔬菜\">蔬菜</a></b>有時被歸入水果。 <sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-AU&#95;3-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-AU-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-UK&#95;4-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UK-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-US&#95;5-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-US-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8F%A0%E8%8F%9C\" title=\"菠菜\">菠菜</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%83%A1%E8%90%9D%E5%8D%9C\" title=\"胡蘿蔔\">胡蘿蔔</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%8B%E8%94%A5\" title=\"洋蔥\">洋蔥</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E8%98%AD%E8%8A%B1\" title=\"西蘭花\">西蘭花</a>等都屬於蔬菜。</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"参考文献\"><span id=\".E5.8F.82.E8.80.83.E6.96.87.E7.8C.AE\"></span>參考文獻</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A3%9F%E7%89%A9%E7%B5%84&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：參考文獻\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173179\">.mw-parser-output cite.citation{font-style:inherit;word-wrap:break-word}.mw-parser-output .citation q{quotes:\"\\\"\"\"\\\"\"\"'\"\"'\"}.mw-parser-output .citation:target{background-color:rgba(0,127,255,0.133)}.mw-parser-output .id-lock-free.id-lock-free a{background:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/65/Lock-green.svg\")right 0.1em center/9px no-repeat}.mw-parser-output .id-lock-limited.id-lock-limited a,.mw-parser-output .